{"title": "Arcane Battery", "pageid": 27735, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Battery", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Arcane_Battery.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Arcane_Battery.webp/300px-Arcane_Battery.webp, /w/images/b/b0/Arcane_Battery.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Arcane_Battery.webp/300px-Arcane_Battery.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Arcane_Battery.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Arcane Battery</b> is a toggleable passive feature which allows the user to cast a spell without using up a spell slot.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Alleviate the arcane burden of spellcasting with the power of this staff. The next spell you cast doesn't cost a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>. \n</p><p>You need to toggle this feature on in order to activate this effect.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd><dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arcane_Battery\"> Condition: Arcane Battery </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Battery_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Battery (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Battery\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Arcane_Battery_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Battery_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Battery (Condition)\">Arcane Battery</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's next spell doesn't cost a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a> in order to cast.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Spellpower\" title=\"Staff of Spellpower\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Quarterstaff_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Spellpower\" title=\"Staff of Spellpower\">Staff of Spellpower</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Resting#Long_rest\" title=\"Resting\">long rest</a> cooldown restriction on Arcane Battery is per <i>character</i>, rather than per <i>item</i>. As such, Arcane Battery can be used repeatedly by passing the weapon possessing this feature to different characters, activating it once on each.</li>\n<li>Arcane Battery is still consumed if active when the character casts a cantrip, despite cantrips not being highlighted in the character's cast bar.</li>\n<li>Toggling Arcane Battery highlights some abilities and items that do not consume spell slots, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Danse_Macabre\" title=\"Danse Macabre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/20px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/30px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/40px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Danse Macabre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp/20px-Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Danse_Macabre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Danse_Macabre\" title=\"Danse Macabre\">Danse Macabre</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">spell scrolls</a>; these abilities and items activate properly, but are still consumed (along with Arcane Battery) in the process.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195805\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2030/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21033/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6264/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 966802/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.795      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   50.795      1 -total\n 31.83%   16.170      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 24.49%   12.440      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 23.53%   11.954      3 Template:Icon_text\n 23.29%   11.832     20 Template:Trim\n 22.80%   11.580      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 18.05%    9.166      1 Template:Recharge\n 18.02%    9.154      2 Template:Item_icon\n 17.35%    8.811      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27735-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195805 and revision id 386538. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}